 "titulo": "12 years at war and no one knew her secret 🗡️ Mulan Part 2 #story #shorts",
 "capa": "A HUNDRED BATTLES",
 "descripcion": "Ten thousand li on horseback, iron armor frozen by the northern wind, a hundred battles. And every night, Mulan had to keep the secret that could get her killed.\n\n> Part 3: {when_next}.\nHow long could you keep a secret like that?\n\nFrom The Ballad of Mulan (Mulan ci), a Chinese folk poem from the Northern Wei era (5th-6th century), preserved in Guo Maoqian's Yuefu Shiji. A legend, not a historical record.\n#mulan #chinesehistory #legend #ancientchina #shorts",
 "visual": "3d",
 "lineas": [
  {
   "texto": "Mulan rode *ten thousand li* to the frontier, across mountains and passes.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "That's further than walking across the whole of China.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "The northern wind froze the iron of her armor at night.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "The poem says the cold light shone on the metal, and the night gong rang in the frost.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "She slept beside men who would kill her if they knew.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "She bathed alone. She spoke low. She never laughed too loud.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Then the riders came over the hills.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Stay, because the poem hides the battles in just one line.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Generals die in a *hundred battles*.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Arrows like rain. Horses screaming. Shields splitting in half.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Mulan fought in the front line, and she didn't fall.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Her commanders died, one after another.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Comrades she had shared fires with, never came back.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Year after year, the war didn't end.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Ten years. Then *twelve*.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "And not one soldier ever found out her secret.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Finally, the survivors were called to the Emperor's hall.",
   "pausa": 0.8
  },
  {
   "texto": "And he wanted to reward Mulan personally. Part three, {when_next}.",
   "pausa": 0.3
  }
 ],
